e make it look like he's not Kira well  one way is to kill off criminals whose  images appeared on live TV while light  was clearly not watching TV so light  turns off the TV and studies however  he's eating chips as he does it and  unbeknownst to L there's a little  portable TV in the bag of chips  of course light knowing where the  cameras are has made it so that the  cameras would not be able to see what's  actually in the bag he appears to be  just eating chips but he's actually  using a small piece of the Death Note  and a small pencil inside of the bag to  write the names of the criminals showing  up on the small portable TV screen all  the wild dramatic music is playing in  the background making the scene feel  epic and intense and in fact it is epic  and intense to ellen lights that it  looks like light is just studying and  eating chips while kira is killing  criminals but in reality light is  killing those people when light says  I'll take a potato chip and eat it it's  one of the most thrilling lines of the  series on the one hand it seems like  he's just eating a potato chip but on  the other hand he's murdering people in  front of his rival Elle's very eyes and  he's completely getting away with it for  someone who has an ego as big as lights  this is the height of satisfaction  he's outsmarting his rival he's winning  the most important battle of his life  while eating potato chips  imagine you were in a fight against the  best fighter in the world and you were  eating potato chips and still kicking  his butt that's how light feels right  now then he act normal  throws out the chip bag with the  expensive portable TV and eventually  watches it get destroyed by the garbage  truck the evidence that he's killed  anyone is completely gone he managed to  pull off murder in front of the number  one number two and number three  detective in the world and he got away  with it there are many more moments of  Lights brilliance but I wanted to focus  on how tampering with a door and eating  potato chips can become insanely  interesting more  interesting then in life-or-death  physical battle when done right that's  the power of a well-written genius  lastly I want to talk about Lelouch from  Code Geass long story short Lelouch is a  rebel genius trying to take down a  corrupt government using his super power  which takes the form of a Geass his  Geass if he can make direct eye contact  allows him to command people to do  anything but it only works once so as  you can see there are limitations as  with a Death Note  without Lelouch is brains his Geass  would not be as useful or as  entertaining Lelouch is extremely good  at chess and that's part of the reason  louche was my favorite anime character  after I first watched koji AHS it was  another anime that hooked me over the  course of the first few episodes but  what especially stuck with me where his  battles against now another Geass user  you seem a little usha script tonight  the louche can practically beat anyone  in chess and outsmart them in battle by  thinking several moves ahead not to  mention he has the benefit of his Geass  power except this gets complicated when  Mao enters the equation Mao can read  Lelouch his mind  so it seems Lelouch can no longer think  several moves ahead of his opponent as  far ahead as he plans Mao can follow his  thought process and beat him since he  always knows what's coming  mouse powers can work beyond a certain  distance but when they are sitting down  together playing chess Lelouch doesn't  stand a chance when Mao reveals that he  no see - who is Aleutians much more  attractive Ryu Lelouch instantly comes  up with fourteen possible identities for  Mao and one of them is right now is a  Geass user who previously had contact  with c2 he is obsessed with c2 and wants  her all to himself  despite the cards being stacked against  him Lelouch figures out a way to beat  mal not once but twice and both times I  loved how Lelouch managed so smart-mouth  in the first case Mao kidnaps c2 and  takes her to an amusement park  now Lelouch knows that if he just gets  within a certain range of mao mao will  be able to read his thoughts and see him  coming so he comes up with a plan he  records himself talking to mao and plays  the recordings on the amusement park  screens as  Lucia explains the MAL leader mouse  thoughts are far too simple because he  uses his mind-reading as a crutch thus  more or less Lelouch was able to predict  what Mao would say and keep him from  discovering that it was just a recording  while Mao was distracted by what he  mistook to be Lelouch is livestream  Lelouch kiosks a bunch of cops and  brought them to take out mal mal needs  to concentrate to increase his range of  mind-reading  so because mal was distracted by the  recording he didn't see it coming  hence Lelouch found a way to turn mouths  Geass against him as a cherry on top of  the cake Lelouch even predicted that mal  would try to reveal that Lelouch is zero  after he lost and so he made that the  signal for the cops to shoot him somehow  Mao survives  apparently Lelouch told the cops to  shoot him rather than kill him  so through Britannia and medical science  Mao comes back to fight in the next  episode is it pretty unrealistic della  louche would make such a mistake and  that mal would be fine after so many  gunshots yeah it is but I'm not even mad  because of how entertaining the second  battle is I even preferred it to the  first mal comes back smarter and more  cautious because he has more experience  fighting again solution now if you know  anything about Lelouch you know that his  little sister Natalie is a single most  important person in his life his whole  goal of creating a more just world  sprang from his love for her so what  does Mao do he kidnaps her this time  this time Lelouch is everything is on  the line  now put nominally close to a bomb if he  wins a chess match against the louche  the bomb will 